attr.shortdesc
3
at a crossroads

<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=
<node>
desc
3
Few roads meet at a crooked signpost, its arms rotted and unreadable. The breeze turns in circles here, as if confused, and each path feels desolate and dangerous.

<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
